    "contentHtml": "<body><turbo-frame><div><a href=\"https://github.dev/\">Open in github.dev</a> <a href=\"https://github.dev/\">Open in a new github.dev tab</a> <a href=\"/codespaces/new/asciimoo/hister?resume=1\">Open in codespace</a> <react-app><p><a type=\"button\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/branches\"><span><span><span><strong>5</strong> Branches</span></span></span></a> <a type=\"button\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tags\"><span><span><span><strong>21</strong> Tags</span></span></span></a></p> <div><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><span>Name</span></th> <th colspan=\"1\"><span>Name</span></th> <th><p><span>Last commit message</span></p></th> <th colspan=\"1\"><p><span>Last commit date</span></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"This path skips through empty directories\" aria-label=\".forgejo/workflows, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/.forgejo/workflows\"><span>.forgejo/</span> <span>workflows</span></a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"This path skips through empty directories\" aria-label=\".forgejo/workflows, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/.forgejo/workflows\"><span>.forgejo/</span> <span>workflows</span></a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[fix] provide nixpkgs search path to updater\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/7cc4ffe43cb107fe2f4649b6ed74f23ab09a6076\">[fix] provide nixpkgs search path to updater</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".github\" aria-label=\".github, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/.github\">.github</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".github\" aria-label=\".github, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/.github\">.github</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"Bump the gha-deps group with 2 updates\n\nBumps the gha-deps group with 2 updates: [docker/setup-qemu-action](https://github.com/docker/setup-qemu-action) and [softprops/action-gh-release](https://github.com/softprops/action-gh-release).\n\n\nUpdates `docker/setup-qemu-action` from 4.2.0 to 4.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/docker/setup-qemu-action/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/docker/setup-qemu-action/compare/96fe6ef7f33517b61c61be40b68a1882f3264fb8...1f40c72289eff860ee54a304f1438e3cff362e0a)\n\nUpdates `softprops/action-gh-release` from 3.0.2 to 3.0.3\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/softprops/action-gh-release/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/softprops/action-gh-release/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/softprops/action-gh-release/compare/v3.0.2...v3.0.3)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: docker/setup-qemu-action\n  dependency-version: 4.3.0\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n  dependency-group: gha-deps\n- dependency-name: softprops/action-gh-release\n  dependency-version: 3.0.3\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: gha-deps\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] &lt;support@github.com&gt;\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/73e1c82326974bd6651bd9e6597b7a04a799212b\">Bump the gha-deps group with 2 updates</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"client\" aria-label=\"client, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/client\">client</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"client\" aria-label=\"client, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/client\">client</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[fix] preserve servers error message for 404 errors\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/081b5df19fc955b3b89986a4b1ab1b7d007b0d66\">[fix] preserve servers error message for 404 errors</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"cmd\" aria-label=\"cmd, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/cmd\">cmd</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"cmd\" aria-label=\"cmd, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/cmd\">cmd</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] append .json extension to backup when it is not specified - fixes #746\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/49b727f40debb4d863d3360ca1718077a4bc44a1\">[enh] append.json extension to backup when it is not specified - </a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"config\" aria-label=\"config, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/config\">config</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"config\" aria-label=\"config, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/config\">config</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"fix: Add metrics to default config template\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/903dd549b43d17b0414ee69fe672ed9bfc2ebf7e\">fix: Add metrics to default config template</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"This path skips through empty directories\" aria-label=\"contrib/systemd, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/contrib/systemd\"><span>contrib/</span> <span>systemd</span></a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"This path skips through empty directories\" aria-label=\"contrib/systemd, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/contrib/systemd\"><span>contrib/</span> <span>systemd</span></a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"Merge pull request 'systemd: Fix removing privileged syscalls from service' (#41) from ISSOtm/hister:syscall-filter into master\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/asciimoo/hister/pulls/41\nReviewed-by: asciimoo &lt;asciimoo@noreply.codeberg.org&gt;\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/79e658429f64d4d744b0879833880bcd6b7c5bcd\">Merge pull request 'systemd: Fix removing privileged syscalls from se…</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"files\" aria-label=\"files, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/files\">files</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"files\" aria-label=\"files, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/files\">files</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[fix] watch symbolically linked directory roots\n\nA directory root reached through a symbolic link was watched by its link\npath, which breaks in two ways.\n\nfsnotify's kqueue backend follows the link and watches the target, so\nmacOS and the BSDs report events under the target path while the\nconfigured root - and every filter built from it - speaks in link paths.\nNothing matched, so no file under such a root was ever reported. inotify\nreports events under the name the watch was registered with, which is why\nLinux and CI never saw it.\n\nfilepath.WalkDir does not descend a symbolic link on any platform, so the\nscan that registers watches stopped at the root and no nested directory\nbelow it was ever observed.\n\n- Resolve each configured root once and record it alongside the path the\n  user configured\n- Register watches and walk the tree at the resolved location; translate\n  event paths back before filtering, scheduling, or reporting, so\n  callbacks keep returning the configured path\n- Tests: a file directly under a symbolically linked root and one in a\n  nested directory both report changes under the configured root\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/c20b7f0cf10c4e5f7e5b2285c54d54603941ebd7\">[fix] watch symbolically linked directory roots</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"nix\" aria-label=\"nix, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/nix\">nix</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"nix\" aria-label=\"nix, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/nix\">nix</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[chore] update Nix hashes for Go/NPM changes\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/13ff3eb84a5bfc783b79fe293cd41fbe7087e5e0\">[chore] update Nix hashes for Go/NPM changes</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"scripts\" aria-label=\"scripts, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/scripts\">scripts</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"scripts\" aria-label=\"scripts, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/scripts\">scripts</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] replace qutebrowser userscript with DevTools companion\n\nAdd `hister companion qutebrowser` to monitor browser tabs through the local Qt WebEngine DevTools endpoint. Extract rendered page content in an isolated world and submit it through the standard authenticated Hister client.\n\nThe Greasemonkey approach could be blocked by page CSP rules and required special form authentication, CSRF bypass, and response handling on the server. The companion keeps the access token outside inspected pages and avoids modifying the existing API protections.\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/25d1f6068e1c579711aa92df69e0f9f2d5c215cb\">[enh] replace qutebrowser userscript with DevTools companion</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"server\" aria-label=\"server, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/server\">server</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"server\" aria-label=\"server, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/server\">server</a></p></td> <td></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"webui\" aria-label=\"webui, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/webui\">webui</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"webui\" aria-label=\"webui, (Directory)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/tree/master/webui\">webui</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[doc] add the metrics to the documentation\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/abe3f9b12f81cc50d7dc6b564bf3b7c094aaedd8\">[doc] add the metrics to the documentation</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".dockerignore\" aria-label=\".dockerignore, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.dockerignore\">.dockerignore</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".dockerignore\" aria-label=\".dockerignore, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.dockerignore\">.dockerignore</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[mod] optimize container builds\n\nReduce repeated work and make container inputs reproducible\n\n- Cache npm, Go module, and Go build data with BuildKit\n- Pin base images and yt-dlp downloads, including checksums\n- Share runtime layers across release, root, and debug targets\n- Add Bake targets and Compose cache sources for local and CI builds\n- Expand context exclusions and track Docker updates with Dependabot\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/ab6b21c98fe47f966e8d26c487fb9bb79c636680\">[mod] optimize container builds</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".editorconfig\" aria-label=\".editorconfig, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.editorconfig\">.editorconfig</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".editorconfig\" aria-label=\".editorconfig, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.editorconfig\">.editorconfig</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] add Prettier and EditorConfig across all workspaces\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/f3fe2ae26383a6973f92241f481eacd03d8b6116\">[enh] add Prettier and EditorConfig across all workspaces</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".fallowrc.json\" aria-label=\".fallowrc.json, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.fallowrc.json\">.fallowrc.json</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".fallowrc.json\" aria-label=\".fallowrc.json, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.fallowrc.json\">.fallowrc.json</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] replace qutebrowser userscript with DevTools companion\n\nAdd `hister companion qutebrowser` to monitor browser tabs through the local Qt WebEngine DevTools endpoint. Extract rendered page content in an isolated world and submit it through the standard authenticated Hister client.\n\nThe Greasemonkey approach could be blocked by page CSP rules and required special form authentication, CSRF bypass, and response handling on the server. The companion keeps the access token outside inspected pages and avoids modifying the existing API protections.\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/25d1f6068e1c579711aa92df69e0f9f2d5c215cb\">[enh] replace qutebrowser userscript with DevTools companion</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".gitattributes\" aria-label=\".gitattributes, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.gitattributes\">.gitattributes</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".gitattributes\" aria-label=\".gitattributes, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.gitattributes\">.gitattributes</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[fix] exclude vendor files from language stats\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/b3c881a249018f6e81a95ee4ed503dd2d5d77893\">[fix] exclude vendor files from language stats</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".gitignore\" aria-label=\".gitignore, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.gitignore\">.gitignore</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".gitignore\" aria-label=\".gitignore, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.gitignore\">.gitignore</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] add rfc fetch dataset command\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/46ff4949adde8643c3ff3bacf4d6cc7d12057081\">[enh] add rfc fetch dataset command</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".golangci.toml\" aria-label=\".golangci.toml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.golangci.toml\">.golangci.toml</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".golangci.toml\" aria-label=\".golangci.toml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.golangci.toml\">.golangci.toml</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[ci] add PR lint workflow for Go, NPM format, and no merge commits\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/9999bca9eb1f8cbf7b9574488a75c8dfc51085ec\">[ci] add PR lint workflow for Go, NPM format, and no merge commits</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".goreleaser-rolling.yml\" aria-label=\".goreleaser-rolling.yml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.goreleaser-rolling.yml\">.goreleaser-rolling.yml</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".goreleaser-rolling.yml\" aria-label=\".goreleaser-rolling.yml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.goreleaser-rolling.yml\">.goreleaser-rolling.yml</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] strip debug symbols from release binary\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/c75ff98a24df581a1e734e5eaa624a8415de6ace\">[enh] strip debug symbols from release binary</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".goreleaser.yml\" aria-label=\".goreleaser.yml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.goreleaser.yml\">.goreleaser.yml</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".goreleaser.yml\" aria-label=\".goreleaser.yml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.goreleaser.yml\">.goreleaser.yml</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] strip debug symbols from release binary\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/c75ff98a24df581a1e734e5eaa624a8415de6ace\">[enh] strip debug symbols from release binary</a></p></td> <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\".prettierignore\" aria-label=\".prettierignore, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.prettierignore\">.prettierignore</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\".prettierignore\" aria-label=\".prettierignore, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/.prettierignore\">.prettierignore</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] replace qutebrowser userscript with DevTools companion\n\nAdd `hister companion qutebrowser` to monitor browser tabs through the local Qt WebEngine DevTools endpoint. Extract rendered page content in an isolated world and submit it through the standard authenticated Hister client.\n\nThe Greasemonkey approach could be blocked by page CSP rules and required special form authentication, CSRF bypass, and response handling on the server. The companion keeps the access token outside inspected pages and avoids modifying the existing API protections.\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/25d1f6068e1c579711aa92df69e0f9f2d5c215cb\">[enh] replace qutebrowser userscript with DevTools companion</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td col