 href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/LICENSE\">LICENSE</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[enh] initial commit\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/53ef811deedf99e5d1abe9e27d84e44493baee8c\">[enh] initial commit</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"README.md\" aria-label=\"README.md, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/README.md\">README.md</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"README.md\" aria-label=\"README.md, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/README.md\">README.md</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"Add 'Why Hister?' section to README\n\nAdded a section explaining the benefits of using Hister for personal search indexing.\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/bccd2f55a23567ebdbf079fccce2ca52be457bd2\">Add 'Why Hister?' section to README</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"SECURITY.md\" aria-label=\"SECURITY.md, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/SECURITY.md\">SECURITY.md</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"SECURITY.md\" aria-label=\"SECURITY.md, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/SECURITY.md\">SECURITY.md</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[doc] add contribution guidelines\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/bd81e07c167bb80c4d561a4d4dc54dbb83784ca0\">[doc] add contribution guidelines</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"compose.yml\" aria-label=\"compose.yml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/compose.yml\">compose.yml</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"compose.yml\" aria-label=\"compose.yml, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/compose.yml\">compose.yml</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[mod] optimize container builds\n\nReduce repeated work and make container inputs reproducible\n\n- Cache npm, Go module, and Go build data with BuildKit\n- Pin base images and yt-dlp downloads, including checksums\n- Share runtime layers across release, root, and debug targets\n- Add Bake targets and Compose cache sources for local and CI builds\n- Expand context exclusions and track Docker updates with Dependabot\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/ab6b21c98fe47f966e8d26c487fb9bb79c636680\">[mod] optimize container builds</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"docker-bake.hcl\" aria-label=\"docker-bake.hcl, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/docker-bake.hcl\">docker-bake.hcl</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"docker-bake.hcl\" aria-label=\"docker-bake.hcl, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/docker-bake.hcl\">docker-bake.hcl</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"[mod] optimize container builds\n\nReduce repeated work and make container inputs reproducible\n\n- Cache npm, Go module, and Go build data with BuildKit\n- Pin base images and yt-dlp downloads, including checksums\n- Share runtime layers across release, root, and debug targets\n- Add Bake targets and Compose cache sources for local and CI builds\n- Expand context exclusions and track Docker updates with Dependabot\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/commit/ab6b21c98fe47f966e8d26c487fb9bb79c636680\">[mod] optimize container builds</a></p></td> <td></td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><a title=\"flake.lock\" aria-label=\"flake.lock, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/flake.lock\">flake.lock</a></p></td> <td colspan=\"1\"><p><a title=\"flake.lock\" aria-label=\"flake.lock, (File)\" href=\"/asciimoo/hister/blob/master/flake.lock\">flake.lock</a></p></td> <td><p><a title=\"Bump nixpkgs from `9387b3f` to `aff8a0b` in the nix-deps group\n\nBumps the nix-deps group with 1 update: [nixpkgs](https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs).\n\n\nUpdates `nixpkgs` from `9387b3f` to `aff8a0b`\n- [Commits](https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/compare/9387b3fcc0c23c86661636da63faabad4235a0a6...aff8a0b28396750446e5537a96461bc4facdb287)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: nixpkgs\n  dependency-version: aff8a0b28396750446e5537a96461bc4facdb287\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: nix-deps\n...\n\nSign